{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_1","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"◎地理中","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_2","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"○南京路河北东路河北西路山东东路山东西路","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_3","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"南京路，国初曰汴京，贞元元年更号南京。府三，领节镇三，防御八，刺史郡八，县一百五。(都城门十四，曰开阳，曰宣仁，曰安利，曰平化。曰通远，曰宜照，曰利川，曰崇德，曰迎秋，曰广泽，曰顺义，曰迎朔，曰顺常，曰广智。宫城门，南外门曰南薰，南薰北新城门曰丰宜，桥曰龙津桥，北门曰丹凤，其门三。丹凤北曰舟桥，桥少北曰文武楼，遵御路而北横街也。东曰太庙，西曰郊社，正北曰承天门，其门五，双阙前引，东曰登闻检院，西曰登闻鼓院。检院东曰左掖门，门南曰待漏院。鼓院西曰右掖门，门南曰都堂。直承天门北曰大庆门，门东曰日精门，又东曰左升平门。大庆门西曰月华门，又西曰右升平门。正殿曰大庆殿，前有龙墀，又南有丹墀，又南曰沙墀，东庑曰嘉福楼，西庑曰嘉瑞楼。大庆后曰德仪殿。殿东曰左升龙门，西曰右升龙门。正门曰隆德，内有隆德殿，有萧墙，有丹墀。隆德殿左曰东上阁门，右曰西上阁门，皆南向。鼓楼在东，钟楼在西。隆德之次曰仁安门、仁安殿，东则内侍局，又东曰近侍局，又东则严祗门，宫中则称曰撒合门，少南曰东楼，则授除楼也。西曰西楼。仁安之次曰纯和殿，正寝也。纯和西曰雪香亭，亭北则后妃位也，有楼，楼西曰琼香亭，亭西曰凉位，有楼，楼北少西曰玉清殿。纯和之次曰福宁殿，殿后曰苑门，内曰仁智殿，有二太湖石，左曰敷锡神运万岁峰，右曰玉京独秀太平岩，殿曰山庄，其西南曰翠微阁。苑门东曰仙韶院，院北曰翠峰，峰之洞曰大涤涌翠，东连长生殿，又东曰涌金殿，又东曰蓬莱殿。长生西曰浮玉殿，又西曰瀛洲殿。长生殿南曰阅武殿，又南曰内藏库。严祗门东曰尚食局，又东曰宣徽院，院北曰御药院，又北右藏库，东则左藏库。宣徽院东曰点检司，司北曰秘书监，又北曰学士院，又北曰谏院，又北曰武器署。点检司南曰仪鸾局，又南曰尚辇局。宣徽院南曰拱卫司，又南曰尚衣局。其南为繁禧门，又南安泰门，门与左升龙门相直。东则寿圣宫，两宫太后位也，本明俊殿，试进士之所。宫北曰徽音院，又北燕寿殿，殿垣后少西曰振肃卫司，东曰中卫尉司。仪鸾局东曰小东华门，更漏在焉。中卫尉司东曰祗肃门，少东南曰将军司。徽音、寿圣东曰太后苑，苑殿曰庆春，与燕寿殿并。小东华与正东华门对。东华门内正北尚厩局，其西北曰临武殿。左掖门北，尚食局南曰宫苑司。其西北尚酝局、汤药局。侍仪司少西曰府宝局、器物局，又西则撒合门也。嘉瑞楼西曰三庙，正殿曰德昌，东曰文昭，西曰光兴。德昌后，宣宗庙也。宫西门曰西华，与东华相直，北门曰安贞。)","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_4","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"开封府，上。留守司留守带本府尹，兼本路兵马都总管。天德二年罢行台尚书省，置转运司、提刑司。天德二年置统军司。(有药市四，榷场。产蜜蜡、香茶、心红、朱红、地龙、黄柏。)天德四年，户二十三万五千八百九十。泰和末，户百七十四万六千二百一十。县十五、镇十五：","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_5","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"开封(东附郭。有古通津、临蔡关、汴河。)镇一(延嘉。)","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_6","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"祥符(西附郭。有岳台、浚水、沙台、崇台、夷门山、蔡河、金水河、广济河、寒泉河。)镇三(陈桥、八角、郭桥。)","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_7","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"阳武(有沙池、黑阳山。黄河、汴河、白沟河。)","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_8","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"通许(宋名咸平，大定二十九年以与咸平府重，更。有牛首城、裘亭。)","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_9","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"泰康(有鲁沟、蔡河、涡河、)镇一(崔桥。)","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_10","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"中牟(有汴河、郑河、中牟台。)镇四(圃田、阳武、万胜、白沙镇。)","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_11","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"杞(宋雍丘县，杞国也，正隆后更今名。)镇一(圉城。)","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_12","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"鄢陵(有洧水、潩水、太丘城。)镇一(马栏桥。)","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_13","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"尉氏(有惠民河、长明沟。)镇二(朱家曲、宋楼。)","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_14","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"扶沟(有祁耶山、洧水、白亭。)镇二(建雄、义店。旧有赤仓镇。)","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_15","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"陈留(有皇柏山、狼丘、汴河。)","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_16","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"延津(贞祐三年七月升为延州。有土山、黄河。)","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_17","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"洧川(贞祐二年置惠民仓，兴定二年四月以尉氏县之宋楼镇升。)","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_18","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"长垣","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_19","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"封丘","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_20","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"睢州，下，刺史。宋拱州保庆军，国初犹称拱州，天德三年更。户四万六千三百六十。县三、镇一：","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_21","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"襄邑(古襄牛地。有汴河、睢水、涣水、承匡城。)镇一(重华。)","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_22","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"考城(宋隶东京，正隆前隶曹州，后来属。有葵丘、黄河、黄陵冈，元光二年改为通安堡。)","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_23","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"柘城(古株林，首止地在焉。有涣水、泡水、泓水。)","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_24","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"归德府，散，中，宣武军。故宋州，宋南京应天府河南郡归德军，国初置宣武军。户七万六千百八十九。县六、镇四：","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_25","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"睢阳(宋名宋城，承安五年更名。有鹰鹭池、汴水、睢水、涣水。)镇一(葛驿。)","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_26","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"宁陵(大定二十二年徙于汴河堤南古城。有汴水、睢水、涣水。)","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_27","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"下邑(有汴水、黄水。)镇一(会亭。)","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_28","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"虞城(有孟诸薮。)","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_29","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"谷熟(有汴水、谷水。)镇二(营城、洛场。又有旧高辛镇。)","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_30","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"楚丘(国初隶曹州，海陵后来属，兴定元年以限河不便，改隶单州。有景山、京冈。)","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_31","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"单州，中，刺史。宋砀郡，贞祐四年二月升为防御，兴定五年二月置招抚司，以安集河北遗黎。户六万五千五百四十五。县四：","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_32","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"单父(有栖霞山、泡沟。)","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_33","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"成武(有堂沟。)","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_34","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"鱼台(有泗水，涓沟、五丈沟。)","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_35","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"砀山(兴定元年以限河不便，改隶归德府。有芒砀山、古汴渠、午沟。)","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_36","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"寿州，下，刺史。宋隶寿春府，贞元元年来属，泰和六年六月升为防御。户八千六百七十七。县二、镇一：","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_37","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"下蔡(有硖石山、颍水、淮水。)","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_38","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"蒙城(宋隶亳州，国初来属。有狼山、涡水。)镇一(蒙馆。)","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_39","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"陕州，下、防御。宋陕郡保平军节度，皇统二年降为防御，贞祐二年七月升为节镇。户四万一千一十。县四、镇七：","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_40","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"陕(倚。有虢山、岘头山、三崤山、底柱山、黄河、橐水。)镇一(石壕。)","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_41","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"灵宝(有夸父山、黄河、稠桑泽、古函谷关。)镇二(乾壕、关东。)","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_42","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"湖城(有荆山、铸鼎原、凤林泉、鼎湖。)镇二(三门、集津。)","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_43","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"阌乡(有太华山、黄河、玉涧水、潼关、太谷关。)镇二(张店、故镇。旧又曹张镇，恐误。)","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_44","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"邓州，武胜军节度使。宋南阳郡，尝置榷场。户二万四千九百八十九。县三、镇六：","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_45","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"穰城(倚。有五垄山、覆釜山、湍水、朝水。)镇四(顺阳、新野、穰东、板桥。)","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_46","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"南阳(有豫山、百重山、丰山、梅溪水、白水、清泠水。)镇一(张村。)","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_47","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"内乡(有高前山、熊耳山、黄水、菊水、淅水、富水。)镇一(峡口。)","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_48","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"唐州，中，刺史。宋准安郡，尝置榷场。户一万一千三十一。县四、镇四：","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_49","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"泌阳(倚。有泌水、醴水。)镇一(胡阳。)","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_50","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"比阳(大明湖、中阳山、比水。)镇一(羊棚。)","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_51","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"湖阳(贞祐元年废。)镇一(罗渠。)","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_52","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"桐柏(大定十年始置正官，兴定五年六月废。有桐柏山、淮水、柘河。)镇一(许封。大定二十八年命规措界壕于唐、邓间。)","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_53","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"裕州，本方城县，泰和八年正月升置，以方城县为倚郭，割汝州叶县、许州舞是隶焉。户八千三百。县三、镇四：","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_54","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"方城(倚。有方城山、衡山、堵水。)镇一(青台。)","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_55","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"叶(隶汝州，泰和八年来属。有方城山、石塘河、澧水。)镇一(临坟。)","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_56","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"舞阳(本隶许州，泰和八年来属。有伏牛山、马鞍山、舞水、汝水、渫水、氵虽水。)镇二(吴城、北舞。)","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_57","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"河南府，散、中。宋西京河南雒阳郡。初置德昌军，兴定元年八月升为中京，府曰金昌。户五万五千六百三十五。县九、(《正隆郡志》有寿安县，纪录皆无。)镇四：","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_58","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"洛阳(倚。有北邙山，正隆六年更名太平山，称旧名者以违制论。有伊、洛、璟、涧、金水，铜驼街、金粟山，金谷。)镇一(龙门。)","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_59","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"渑池(有天坛山、广阳山、黄河、渑河。)","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_60","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"登封(有太室山、箕山、阳城山、少室山，宣宗置御寨其上。旧有颍阳镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_61","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"孟津(贞祐三年七月升为陶州，十二月复为县。)镇一(长泉。旧有河清镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_62","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"芝田(宋名永安，贞元元年更。有轘辕山、青龙山。)","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_63","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"新安(有阙门山、长石山、金水、谷水、陂水。)","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_64","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"偃师(有北邙山、缑氏山、半石山、景山、黄河、洛水。)镇一(缑氏。)","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_65","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"宜阳(有锦屏山、鹿蹄山、憩鹤山、女几山、洛水，昌水，少水。)","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_66","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"巩(有侯山、九山、黄河、洛水。)镇一(洛口。)","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_67","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"嵩州，中，刺史。旧名顺州，天德三年更。户二万六千六百四十九。县四、镇四：","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_68","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"伊阳(宋隶河南府。有三涂山、陆浑山、鼓钟山，伊水、淯阳水。)镇一(鸣皋。旧有伊阙镇，后废。)","sentenceO