":99},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_100","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"汝阳(有溱水、澺水。)镇一(保城。)","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_101","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"遂平(有吴房山、吴城山、龙泉水、瀙水。)","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_102","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"上蔡","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_103","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"西平(有九头山、滚水、邓艾陂。)","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_104","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"确山(有确山、没水、溱水。)镇一(毛宗。)","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_105","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"平舆","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_106","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"息州，本新息县，泰和八年升为息州，以新息为倚郭，割真阳、褎信、新蔡隶焉，为蔡州支郡。户九千六百八十五。县四、镇一：","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_107","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"新息(倚。)镇一(王务。)","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_108","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"真阳(本隶蔡州，泰和八年来属。有淮水、汝水、石塘陂。)","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_109","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"褎信(本隶蔡州，泰和八年来属。有汝水、葛陂。)","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_110","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"新蔡(本隶蔡州，泰和八年来属。有汝水。)","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_111","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"郑州，中，防御，宋荥阳郡奉宁军节度。户四万五千六百五十七。县七、镇三：","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_112","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"管城(倚。贞祐四年更名故市。有圃田泽。)","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_113","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"荥阳(有鸿沟，京、索二水。)","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_114","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"密(有大騩山、溱水、洧水。)镇二(大騩、锁水。)","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_115","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"河阴","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_116","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"原武镇一(陈桥。)","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_117","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"汜水(有虎牢关。)","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_118","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"荥泽(有广武涧。旧有许桥、贾谷二镇，在郑境。)","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_119","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"颍州，下，防御。宋顺昌府汝阴郡。尝置榷场，正隆四年罢榷场。户一万六千七百一十四。县四、镇十一：(旧有万善镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_120","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"汝阴(倚。有颍水、淮水、淝水、汝水。)","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_121","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"颍上(元光二年十一月改隶寿州。有颍水、淮水。)镇十(永宁、漕口、王家市、栎头、永清、椒陂、正阳、江陂、界沟、斤沟。)","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_122","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"泰和(有颍水。)","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_123","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"沈丘(有武丘。)镇一(永安。)","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_124","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"宿州，中，防御。宋符离郡保静军节度，隶扬州。国初隶山东西路，大定六年来属。贞祐三年升为节镇，军曰保静。户五万五千五十八。县四、镇八：(旧有荆山镇。)","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_125","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"符离(倚。有诸阳山、汴河、睢水、陴湖。)镇三(曲沟、符离、黄团。)","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_126","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"临涣(有嵇山、汴河、肥水。)镇三(柳子、蕲泽、桐墟。)","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_127","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"灵壁(宋元祐元年置。)镇一(西固)","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_128","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"蕲(有涣水、涡水、蕲水。)镇一(静安。)","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_129","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"泗州，中，防御使。宋临淮郡。正隆四年正月罢凤翔府、唐、邓、颍、蔡、巩、洮等州并胶西县诸榷场，但置榷场于泗州。先隶山东西路，大定六年来属。户八千九十二。县四、镇六：","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_130","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"淮平(旧盱眙县，明昌六年以宋有盱眙军，故更。)","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_131","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"虹(有朱山、汴河、淮水、广济渠。)镇二(千仙、通海。)","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_132","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"临淮镇四(安河、吴城、青阳、翟家湾。)","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_133","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"睢宁(兴定二年四月以宿迁县之古城置。又有淮滨，兴定二年四月以桃园置，元光二年四月废。)","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_134","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"边戍，皇统元年十月，都元帅宗弼与宋约，以淮水中流为界，西自邓州南四十里、西南四十里为界。泰和八年设沿淮巡检使，及朐山县完渎村创立巡路，置巡检。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_135","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"河北东路。天会七年析河北为东、西路，名置本路兵马都总管。府一，领节镇二，防御一，刺郡五，县三十，镇三十五。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_136","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"河间府，中，总管府，瀛海军。宋河间郡瀛海军。天会七年置总管府，正隆间升为次府，置瀛州瀛海军节度使兼总管，置转运司。后复置总管府，河北东西大名等路提刑司(产无缝绵、沧盐、蔺席、马蔺花、香附子、钱虾蟹、乾鱼。)户三万一千六百九十一。县二、镇三：","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_137","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"河间(倚。有滹沱河、君子馆。)镇三(束城、永宁、北林。)","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_138","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"肃宁","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_139","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"蠡州，下，刺史。宋永宁军，国初因之，天会七年升为宁州博野郡军，天德三年更为蠡州。户二万九千七百九十七。县一、镇一：","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_140","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"博野(倚。有沙河、唐河。)镇一(新桥。)","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_141","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"莫州，下，刺史。宋文安郡军防御，治任丘。贞祐二年五月降为鄚亭县。户二万二千九百三十三。县一、镇一：","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_142","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"任丘镇一(长丰。)","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_143","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"献州，下，刺史。本乐寿县，天会七年升为寿州，天德三年更今名。户五万六百三十二。县二、镇十：","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_144","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"乐寿(倚。有徒骇河、房渊、汉献王陵。)","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_145","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"交河(大定七年以石家圈置。)镇十(景城、南大树、刘解、槐家、参军、贯河、北望、夹滩、策河、沙涡。)","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_146","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"冀州，上。宋信都郡，天会七年仍旧置安武军节度。户三千六百七十。县五、镇三：","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_147","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"信都(倚。有胡卢河、降水。)镇一(来远，后废。)","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_148","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"南宫(有降枯渎。)镇三(唐阳、后增宁化、七公二镇。)","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_149","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"衡水(有长芦河、降水。)","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_150","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"武邑(有漳河、长芦河。)镇一(观津，后废。)","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_151","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"枣强镇一(广川，后废。)","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_152","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"深州，上刺史。宋饶阳郡防御，因初为刺郡。户五万六千三百四十。县五、镇一：","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_153","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"静安(倚。有衡漳水、大陆泽。)镇一(下博。)","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_154","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"束鹿(有衡漳水、滹沱河。)","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_155","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"武强(置河仓。有衡漳水、武强泉。)","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_156","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"饶阳(有滹沱河。)","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_157","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"安平(有沙水、滹沱河。)","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_158","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"清州，中。宋乾宁郡军，国初因置军，天会七年以守边置防御。户四万七千八百七十五。县三、镇一：","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_159","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"会川(本名乾宁，贞元元年更名。置河仓。)镇一(范桥。)","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_160","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"兴济(本隶沧州，大定六年来属。)","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_161","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"靖海(明昌四年以清州窝子口置。)","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_162","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"沧州，上，横海军节度。宋景城郡。贞元二年来属。户一十万四千七百七十四。县五、镇十一：","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_163","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"清池(置河仓。有浮阳水、徒骇河)镇五(长芦、旧饶安、乾符、郭疃。旧有郭侨，后废。)","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_164","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"无棣(有老乌山、鬲津河。)镇一(分水。)","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_165","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"盐山(有盐山、浮水。)镇四(海丰、海润，后增利丰、扑头二镇。)","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_166","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"南皮(置河仓。有大、小台山、永济渠、洁河。)镇一(马明。)","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_167","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"乐陵(有鬲津河、笃马河、钩盘河、旧有会宁河、永利、东中三镇、后废。)","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_168","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"景州，上，刺史。宋永静军同下州，治东光。国初升为景州，贞元二年来属。大安间更为观州，避章庙讳也。户六万五千八百二十八。县六、镇四：","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_169","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"东光(倚。置河仓。有永济渠、漳河。)镇一(建桥。)","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_170","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"阜城(有衡水、漳水河。刘豫祖茔在县南十二里。)","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_171","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"将陵(置河仓。有永济渠、钩盘河。)","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_172","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"吴桥(有永济渠。)","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_173","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"蓚(宋隶冀州。有漳河、蓚市。)","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_174","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"宁津镇三(西保安、广平、会津。)","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_175","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"河北西路。天会七年析为西路。府三，领节镇二，防御二，刺郡五，县六十一。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_176","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"真定府，上，总管府，成德军。宋常山郡镇州成德军节度，正隆间依旧次府，置本路兵马都总管府、转运司。(产瓷器、铜、铁。有丹粉场、乌梨。药则有茴香、零陵香、御米壳、天南星、皂角、木瓜、芎、井泉石。)户一十三万七千一百三十七。县九、镇三：","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_177","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"真定(倚。有大茂山、滋水、滹沱水。)","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_178","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"藁城(有滋水、滹沱水。)","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_179","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"平山","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_180","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"栾城(有泜水、洨水。)","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_181","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"获鹿(兴定三年三月升为镇宁州，权河北西路，以经略使武仙驻焉。有萆山、滹沱水。)","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_182","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"行唐(有玉女山、常山。)镇二(嘉祐、北镇。旧有行台、新年二镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_183","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"阜平(明昌四年以北镇置。)","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_184","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"灵寿　镇一(慈谷。)","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_185","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"元氏(有封龙山、槐河。)","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_186","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"威州，下，刺史。天会七年以井陉县升，置陉山郡军，后为刺郡。户八千三百一十。县一：","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_187","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"井陉","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_188","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"沃州，上，刺史。宋徽宗升为庆源府赵郡庆源军，治平棘。天会七年改为赵州，天德三年更为沃州，盖取水沃火之义，军曰赵郡军。后废军。户三万八千一百八十五。县七、镇一：","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_189","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"平棘(倚。有洨水、槐水。)","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_190","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"临城(有敦舆山、彭山、泜水。)","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_191","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"高邑(有赞皇山、济水。)","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_192","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"赞皇","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_193","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"宁晋(有洨水、寝水。)镇一(奉城。)","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_194","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"柏乡","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_195","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"隆平","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_196","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"邢州，上，安国军节度。宋信德府钜鹿郡安国军节度，天会七年降为邢州，仍置安国军节度。(产玄精石。)户八万二百九十二。县八、镇四：","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_197","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"邢台(有石门山、百岩山、蓼水、涡水。)","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_198","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"唐山(有尧山、泜水。)","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_199","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"内丘(有干言山、内丘山、泜水、渚水。)","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_200","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"平乡　镇一(道武。)","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_201","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"任(有溹水、任水。)镇一(新店。)","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_202","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"沙河(有汤水、湡水。)镇一(綦村。)","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_203","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"南和(有任水、泜水。)","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_204","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"钜鹿(有大陆泽、漳河、落漠水。)镇一(团城。)","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_205","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"洺州，上，防御，广平郡。治永年。天会七年以守边置防御使。户七万三千七十。县九、镇四：","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_206","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"永年(有榆溪山、洺水、漳水。)镇一(西临洺。)","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_207","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"广平(本魏县，大定七年更。)","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_208","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"宗城","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_209","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"新安","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_210","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"成安","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_211","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"肥乡镇一(新安。)","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_212","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"鸡泽(有洺水、漳水、沙河。)","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_213","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"曲周　镇二(平恩、白家滩。)","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_214","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"洺水","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_215","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"彰德府，散，下。宋相州邺郡彰德军节度，治安阳。天会七年仍置彰军节度，明昌三年升为府，以军为名。户七万七千二百七十六。县五、镇五。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_216","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"安阳(倚。有韩陵山、龙山、洹水、防水。)镇三(天祐、永和、丰乐。)","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_217","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"林卢(旧林卢镇，贞祐三年十月升为林州，置元帅府。兴定三年九月升为节镇，以安阳县水治村为辅岩县隶焉。有隆卢山、洹水、漳水。)","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_218","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"汤阴(有牟山、羑水、荡水、通漕、羑里。)镇一(鹤壁。)","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_219","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"临漳(东山、漳水。)镇一(邺镇。)","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_220","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"辅岩(本水治村，兴定三年置。)","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_221","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"磁州，中，刺史。宋滏阳郡，国初置滏阳郡军。户六万三千四百一十七。县三、镇八：","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_222","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"滏阳(有滏山、磁山、漳水、滏水。)镇四(台城、观城、昭德，后废二祖增临水镇。)","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_223","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"武安(有锡山、武安山)镇一(固镇。)","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_224","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"邯郸(有邯山、灵山、漳水、牛首山。)镇三(大赵、北阳、邑城。《士民须知》惟有邯山镇。)","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_225","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"中山府。宋府，天会七年降为定州博陵郡定武军节度使，后复为府。户八万三千四百九十。县七、镇二：","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_226","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"安喜(倚。有滱水、卢奴水、长星川。)","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_227","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"新乐(有派水、木刀沟。)","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_228","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"无极(有澬河。)","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_229","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"永平(贞祐二年四月升为完州。)","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_230","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"庆都(有尧山、都山、唐水。)","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_231","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"曲阳(剧。有常山、曲防水。)镇一(龙泉。)","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_232","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"唐(有孤山、唐山、滱水。)镇一(军城。)","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_233","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"祁州，中，刺史。宋蒲阴郡，国初置蒲阴郡军。户二万三千三百八十二。县三：","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_234","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"蒲阴","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_235","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"鼓城","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_236","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"深泽","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_237","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"浚州，中，防御。宋大邳郡通利军，又改平川军。天会七年以边境置防御使。皇统八年，嫌与宗峻音同。更为通州，天德三年复。户二万九千三百一十九。县二、镇二：","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_238","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"黎阳(有大伾山、枉人山。)","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_239","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"卫(有苏门山、鹿台、糟丘、酒池、枋头城。)镇二(卫桥、淇门。)","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_240","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"卫州，下，河平军节度。守汲郡，天会七年因宋置防御使，明昌三年升为河平军节度，治汲县、以滑州为支郡。大定二十六年八月以避河患，徙于共城。二十八年复旧治。贞祐二年七月城宜村，三年五月徙治于宜村新城，以胙城为倚郭。正大八年以石甃其城。户九万一百一十二。县四、镇二","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_241","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"汲(有苍山、黄河。)","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_242","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"新乡","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_243","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"苏门(本共城，大定二十九年改为河平，避显宗讳也。明昌三年改为今名。贞祐三年九月升为辉州，兴定四年置山阳县隶焉。有白鹿山、天门山、淇水、百门陂。)镇一(早生。)","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_244","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"获嘉镇一(大宁。)","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_245","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"胙城(本隶南京，海陵时割隶滑州，泰和七年复隶南京，八年以限河来属。贞祐五年五月为卫州倚郭。增置主薄。兴定四年以修武县重泉村置县，来隶。)","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_246","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"滑州，下，刺史。宋灵河郡武成军。本南京属郡，大定六年割隶大名府。户二万二千五百七十。县二、镇二：","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_247","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"白马镇二(卫南、武城。)","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_248","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"内黄(本隶大名府，大定六年来属。)","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_249","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"山东东路，宋为京东东路，治益都。府二，领节镇二，防御二，刺郡七，县五十三，镇八十三。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_250","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"益都府，上，总管府，宋镇海军，国初仍旧置军，置南青州节度使，后升为总管府，置转运司。大定八年置山东东西路统军司。(产石器、玉石、沙鱼皮、天南星、半夏、泽泻、紫草。)户一十一万八千七百一十八。县七、镇七：","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_251","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"益都","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_252","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"临朐(有朐山、几山、洱水、般水。)","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_253","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"穆陵(贞祐四年四月升临朐之穆陵置。)","sentenceOrder":25