_kim_su_25_317","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"阳谷(有黄河、碻磝津。)镇二(乐安、定水。)","sentenceOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_318","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"汶上(本名中都、贞元元年更为汶阳，泰和八年更今名。有汶水，大野陂。)镇一(柴城。)","sentenceOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_319","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"寿张(大定七年河水坏城，迁于竹口镇，十九年复旧治)镇一(竹口。)","sentenceOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_320","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"平阴(有郁葱山、鸱夷山。)镇九(但欢、安宁、宁乡、翔鸾、固留、滑口、广里、石横、澄空、傅家岸。)","sentenceOrder":320},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_321","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"济州，中刺史。宋济阳郡。旧治钜野，天德二年徙治任城县，分钜野之民隶嘉祥、郓城、金乡三县。户四万四百八十四。县四、镇二：","sentenceOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_322","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"任城(倚。有承注山、泗水、新河。)镇一(鲁桥。)","sentenceOrder":322},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_323","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"金乡(有桓沟。)镇一(昌邑。)","sentenceOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_324","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"嘉祥(旧有合来、山口二镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_325","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"郓城(大定六年五月徙治盘沟村以避河决。有马颊河、濮水。)","sentenceOrder":325},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_326","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"徐州，下，武宁军节度使。宋彭城郡，贞祐三年九月改隶河南路。户四万四千六百八十九。县三、镇五：","sentenceOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_327","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"彭城(倚。有九里山、赭土山、泗水、猴水、沛泽。)镇三(吕梁、利国、卞唐。又有厥堌镇，元光二年升为永固县。)","sentenceOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_328","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"萧(有绥舆山、丁公山、古汴渠。)镇二(白土、安民。旧有晋城、双沟二镇。)","sentenceOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_329","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"丰(有泡水、大泽。)","sentenceOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_330","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"邳州，中，刺史。宋淮阳军，贞祐三年九月改隶河南路。户二万七千二百三十二。县三：","sentenceOrder":330},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_25_331","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_25","textTraditional":"下邳(有峄阳山，磬石山、艾山、沂水、泗水、